    <profile name="Atomantic Deflector" id="cd7c-46f6-7711-85b3" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">A model with an atomantic deflector gains a 5+ Invulnerable Save, in addition any model with an atomantic deflector and a Wounds Characteristic that suffers an unsaved Wound with the Instant Death special rule is not immediately removed as a casualty, but instead loses D3 Wounds instead. When a model with an atomantic deflector loses its last Wound or Hull Point, but before it is removed as a casualty or replaced with a Wreck, all models both friendly and enemy within D6&quot; suffer an automatic Hit at Str 8, AP -.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Infernus Incinerator" id="8c5f-c7cc-2fcb-0b21" hidden="false" publicationId="3ff9-2058-b559-545b" typeId="66fe-f217-d00c-847a" typeName="Weapon">
