    <profile name="Eclipse Shield" id="c104-a001-0001-0005" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">A vehicle with an Eclipse Shield reduces the Strength of Shooting attacks made against its Front Armour by 1, or by 2 if the attack uses a Blast or template. It has no effect on Destroyer attacks. After a Glancing or Penetrating Hit against its Front Armour, the vehicle gains Shrouded (5+) against subsequent Shooting attacks against its Front Armour during that phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
