            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="d33e-1fdc-0c00-8cb8">3+/6++</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df9-f556-8725-fe75">Legio Custodes, Chosen Warriors, Relentless, Stubborn, Firing Protocols (2), Skilled Rider, Hammer of Wrath (1), Deep Strike, Outflank</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Dawneagle Jetbike" id="f003-d44c-ae2a-a58e" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">A Dawneagle Jetbike confers the Bike subtype a 2+ armour save and the Bulky (4) special rule. In addition, when a Dawneagle Jetbike makes a run move it gains the (Shrouded 5+) special rule until the start of the Controlling Player&apos;s next turn. 


Jetbikes can move over all other models and terrain freely. However, if a moving Jetbike begins or ends its move in difficult terrain, it must take a Dangerous Terrain test. Jetbikes cannot end their move over other models or impassable terrain, except that they can end their move on top of impassable terrain if it is actually possible to place the models on top of it. If they do so, they treat the impassable terrain as dangerous terrain.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
