              <profiles>
                <profile name="Praesidium Shield" id="3096-b057-f2e0-a199" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">A Praesidium shield confers a 5+ Invulnerable Save 


A model with Terminator Armour who also has a Praesidium Shield may re-roll Invulnerable Saves of 1 to represent the overlapping energy fields.


In addition, a model with a Praesidium shield cannot claim bonus attacks for having more than one melee weapon, or make attacks during the Assault phase using a weapon with the Two-handed special rule.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
